@startuml model_manager_chat_call
' Source baseline: pi-mono-java 0d7a12e1dd89eed52f6e12db717fd5703b6b2125.
' Source evidence: modules/ai/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/ai/CampusClawAiService.java, CampusClawAiService.streamSimple.
' Source evidence: modules/ai/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/ai/provider/mate/MateServiceModelManagerProvider.java, streamSimple.
' Source evidence: modules/ai/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/ai/provider/mate/MateChatRequestMapper.java, map.
' Source evidence: modules/ai/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/ai/provider/mate/MateChatSseParser.java, accept.
' Observed behavior: the merged baseline routes legacy providers by Api and has no Mate Chat provider.
' Architecture change: managed providers are keyed by ProviderId and take precedence over legacy Api routing.
' Product constraint: CampusClaw calls the five Model Manager operations without application credentials.
' Security hardening: only Mate owns upstream endpoints, model identifiers, credentials, and controlled headers.
title Mate Chat provider call
actor AgentLoop
component CampusClawAiService
component AiProviderRegistry
component MateServiceModelManagerProvider
component CampusMate
cloud "Upstream LLM" as Upstream

AgentLoop -> CampusClawAiService: Context and Model
CampusClawAiService -> AiProviderRegistry: resolve mate-model-manager
AiProviderRegistry --> CampusClawAiService: ProviderAuth.none
CampusClawAiService -> MateServiceModelManagerProvider: streamSimple
MateServiceModelManagerProvider -> MateServiceModelManagerProvider: map Context to Chat JSON
MateServiceModelManagerProvider -> CampusMate: POST /mate-service/v1/LLM/chat\nno application credentials
CampusMate -> Upstream: rewrite model and inject private route credentials
Upstream --> CampusMate: raw OpenAI Chat SSE
CampusMate --> MateServiceModelManagerProvider: byte-transparent SSE
MateServiceModelManagerProvider --> AgentLoop: AssistantMessageEvent
AgentLoop -> MateServiceModelManagerProvider: cancel subscription
MateServiceModelManagerProvider -> CampusMate: close HTTP/SSE connection
@enduml

@startuml runtime_usage_persistence
' Source baseline: pi-mono-java 0d7a12e1dd89eed52f6e12db717fd5703b6b2125.
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeEventProjector.java, persistAssistant and projectCompactionCompleted.
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/persistence/MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository.java, appendEntryWithUsage.
' Source evidence: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/resources/db/gaussdb/install/session_schema.sql.
' Pi evidence: packages/agent/src/harness/session/types.ts, UsageRecord and SessionStats.
' Pi evidence: packages/session-backends/sqlite-node/src/sqlite/repo.ts, appendRecord.
' Observed behavior: the merged Java baseline stores lifetime usage in materialized session JSON.
' Design reason: usage is a run fact and must not become a branch entry or change active_leaf_id.
' Java divergence: openGauss uses t_ prefixed tables and one transaction instead of the pi SQLite write queue.
title Runtime usage record and stats transaction
participant RuntimeEventProjector
participant MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository
database t_session_sequences
database t_session_entries
database t_session_records
database t_session_stats
database t_sessions

RuntimeEventProjector -> MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository: Entry, Usage Record, Usage
activate MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository
MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository -> t_sessions: lock session
MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository -> t_session_sequences: allocate entry_seq
MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository -> t_session_entries: insert branch Entry
MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository -> t_sessions: update active_leaf_id to Entry
MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository -> t_session_sequences: allocate record_seq
MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository -> t_session_records: insert lane=main Usage Record
MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository -> t_session_stats: increment message and pi usage totals
MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository --> RuntimeEventProjector: commit one transaction
deactivate MyBatisRuntimeSessionRepository

note right of t_session_records
Record sequence may create legal gaps
between public Entry sequence values.
Records never update active_leaf_id.
end note
@enduml
